# Visual Studio
# Anchored to the repo root: git ignores paths case-insensitively on Windows, so
# an unanchored Debug/ also matches src/debug/. Build output goes to build/ and
# obj/ anyway (see OutDir/IntDir in RuptureTimer.vcxproj).
.vs/
/x64/
/Debug/
/Release/
